biology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.s001\" target=\"_blank\">S1A Fig</a> (MERS-CoV data). Tab 4: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.s001\" target=\"_blank\">S1A Fig</a> (HCoV-229E data). Tab 5: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.s001\" target=\"_blank\">S1B Fig</a>. Tab 6: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.g003\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 3A</a>. Tab 7: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.g003\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 3B</a>. Tab 8: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.g003\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 3C\u20133F</a>. Tab 9: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.g003\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 3G</a>. Tab 10: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.g003\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 3I</a>. Tab 11: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.g004\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 4D</a>. Tab 12: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.g005\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 5A</a>. Tab 13: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.g005\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 5B</a>. Tab 14: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.g005\" target=\"_blank\">Fig 5C</a>. Tab 15: Raw data for <a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001490#pbio.3001490.s004\" target=\"_blank\">S4B Fig</a>. Tab 1